%% Logical deployment; verify live URLs/secrets from the target environment.
flowchart TB
    USERS[Browser users] -->|HTTPS| FE[Next.js frontend]
    FE -->|JWT REST/SSE| BE[FastAPI backend]
    BE -->|SQL/TLS| PG[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]
    FE -->|direct upload| STORE[(Cloudinary)]
    FE -->|submit public URL| BE
    BE -->|store URL / delete asset| STORE
    BE -->|service token + signed identity| AGENT[FastAPI Agent]
    AGENT --> GRAPH[LangGraph + workers]
    GRAPH -->|vector operations| CH[(Local/Cloud Chroma)]
    GRAPH -->|LLM/embedding/VLM/rerank| MODEL[OpenAI or FPT-compatible gateway]
    DEV[Docker Compose local] -. packages .-> FE
    DEV -. packages .-> BE
    DEV -. packages .-> AGENT
